{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1514,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc39728910157597dcee788d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……难道说当训练员\r\n不爱多管闲事是不行的吗？\r\n……肯定是不行的吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0704761d32ec1aa9df891c41f595e69b899b4246194315b96adbee7504654016",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c4236e859deb63cf2d86ba8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我出发了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "874e7497e7be8367a4f334f4c7f1d69916bd93469660e8935829876ff0311191",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c46c2ca8a109eeba006904b2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我回来了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f3f071de3a132d55ed31edf557b362afda8ef29b618fd0f52a13920ed7d26bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c5f3279c501bf57481ebeecd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你的分析能力和观察力，很准确。\n……你也是有自知之明才来推销自己\n的吧？那我就好好利用了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4161a8a9c97b13be17911534384effa2c794ccd76898141b77f5f95553f329ec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c089df9a0cf70adf5e73428f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……训练员室。最近，东西\n是不是变多了？特别是……狗——\n不。您的私人物品。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d2dd55d0fb31dd5a4edad774fd455567c526af97608f8fdc4369b6b02e8beb3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a6950885f87fd6a06a9b4ef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我姑且还是吃了御节料理和\r\n杂煮的。……说是学生会发放的，\r\n每年都会送过来……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a68bd8b9a65567b6d4ac856fa40e2c1ef78bbbe75f8770c35ed43658d6c58c7e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1027f7bef2f83d23e86ebc4d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……被巧克力的甜味，\r\n轻而易举地引诱堕落的人\r\n还真多呢……我不需要。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e738551d4d06297ad0efa3e1a1442d08ce80e35f1f56ba950ce539a726e5b0c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:def79bed56e7d355e7428229",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……我不能收巧克力。因为\r\n会使人堕落。……嗯，真的。\r\n……我已经决定好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "201c73fc52466984d8c7a4979fa0beb8f5ccfa901c901da0f3d5fb8842bf9e22",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:887cab66a86b458df47e5248",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……为什么大家能那么毫不在乎地\r\n把自己的愿望暴露出来呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8a7977915c9cdb464e263fdd96f4b9253189477dc49db4f7e29719e21dd9d24",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9385655013556fe8209ffc8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在设施里，也有不管是谁都用糖果\r\n和恶作剧来让人做选择的孩子……\r\n……所以我随身带着。糖果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c920631ed5fd45bced8d84f8aa52dd2e3964324ccc8089a79c8dcb4c151b6d71",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f366a18ef7a20202ab8d8eb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还是来了啊，圣诞节……\r\n今天我要早点回房间。我可受不了\r\n被卷进骚动里。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3bef56e4df95cc9bd70de6869baa5a99890ea8b21aefeab5b9969dcb33479043",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04612fa71bd7d206215f4bcd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "圣诞快乐。\r\n……只是打个招呼而已。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a051b3217630223bcc0e8c20dd36ecada6b0f1f49cdff38e86b98462acd2526",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c5aed1890fcbfa61e526ddb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "胜利是理所当然的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "245e004ac87220151d5c2c1eed723dd7306eb40b9c9e7a151e38fccd01e87c2d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cdd1f0393833755f469eaa4c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "您回老家的时候，请把训练\r\n计划表留下来。\r\n我会留在学园里的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "757160ed6e765be5cf3428f861480760fb18933812517d98e574fb586982fb33",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ca9f6eebc747928f69ab9c1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日。这样啊。\r\n……太好了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f13b7a1ac0f19a5e6bfab502261870b35fcfc04a1ca8774487682004af07429",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:472623e7f21640163b77b78c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……你吃蛋糕了吗？\r\n……没，那个——……是因为\r\n学生餐厅里有卖……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d25e61f05485e670243b726cd82e976c57ea3f4bafc13d4a69bb124a784c74a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8bed0d872540f4056cf2d4bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯，是啊。生日。\r\n……所以呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9d14c7e075a6530840b026d57a4ba4e27794bfddcba425fdd70b9db43b492a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04533a39145c59109ca9517d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……那个，不用了。\r\n就算过生日……也不用，\r\n那么费心……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b73e1a70059113dd631d3f8822201608945c48caa683be1186084710ffb45ef6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c7ecc0a25c32be8f9a7650e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有通知来了哦。\r\n不去确认一下吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9118b4c63de6396f5828d1de3c6a0d1c69b77ac785ddeb11f95d3ea92b6d0b64",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44f6f5a48097abb872c6da08",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像有礼物送来。\r\n……给你的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "261c24e02c71492404bd77add1771b9531e91f8c87d2f88ee2b67fcc2b85e93e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81a567f34551975599e94720",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "任务完成，辛苦了。\r\n那么开始进行下一个课题吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2873bab410cbd1d3f785a1acbfb969319fa5e7a0686a417fa3a4727233583cf0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43e504543e2d93f2c8fb12e9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动的公告已经发出来了呢。\r\n……如果您感兴趣的话，请去吧。\r\n我就……不必了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a6b55a0edf7751d25b74647a941897d5f093da61d882d4b37e1229d39c2fd9d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:acde02af9ab8998c3f0d8dda",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动已经开始了。\r\n您去参加一下比较好吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8fddaa9a027275474ed5851a9b4b401efb70f4e89fbf7c002d96c5bdf44b2410",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d96302292e86b5c6d829e76",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为什么……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4acd8823111dabf049aa21daa7d3d761b3fe48ec0e1304a8c87ccc9d87d50f9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7a2a801ed8319ef0b44c5db",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "名鉴等级似乎提升了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9fa58b8d9d676ccdff6f319a973a696a186cfc24e60d1b2b6c0b0b1c0e4c058b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d75f21c163f063347762fd24",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……选衣服的时候\r\n不会上来搭话的店。我只在\r\n那种地方买衣服。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae11752d32d32563b16e31f8edab93adcbe9dce29c4cb203135d3f2a9758e663",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3570775f25fe44c733048ca9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "被转手售出的饰品。……去古着店，\n偶尔就是为了寻找这种\n有韵味的东西。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3571c3b3eee3892c41fc9e321090a632ddc5eb76acadedb0544cf2d327a35bf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:526ac1ec6f7231ee690b3aac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……衣服的，洗涤标签。\r\n很扎人……\r\n要是能消失就好了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "32828abad1a4915d6d7efd52da9d594b4cffdf0b338a35cbbaae9e0a2303cd51",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57a785735483ea6dbf34e84f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没有下一次了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5de0dacff5d810f60e98fefe143f3120cf6ec5d188ef6b2fb4b175c07db03f82",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44b305ff3d363729ba731cf7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我不会得意忘形的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "111ddaf1a9558f3b490cf979826a4193888264f543062360387df83de5dbea46",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab0c6d51256314a360d29ea5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为什么……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4acd8823111dabf049aa21daa7d3d761b3fe48ec0e1304a8c87ccc9d87d50f9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:419b12015628394bc20e731b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没有下一次了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5de0dacff5d810f60e98fefe143f3120cf6ec5d188ef6b2fb4b175c07db03f82",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21aa257a13db8d881f3fe4b0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最高分更新了，是吗。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e3cb244a13ca36fed6e860859dc13a60dbdcfd604f791c90b9b6267bf29f51c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4fff5c985e7a9e6b9ee506c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请多关照……",
      "source_fingerprint": "76e546beb607c78391a13a35fae42de155540fc89abd524192b761dd1d1f1747",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30aed8b8b43e5e2efe45d1d9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9cc363272b180e0126a7791b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是来找我商量训练的事吗？\r\n……请长话短说。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab522987fb5b6bedf31d3d042dc08f24aca4a485714128d301a3239084537db8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cba5696e8e2cacd605280486",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……我对别人的故事不感兴趣。\r\n不过，历史还是有学习价值的",
      "source_fingerprint": "868b874b8b1f1d9f020622a1a3e4585f20278567490d81d306d8b0438379198f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "110001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:008f514bb71ba01169789e7b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛事吗。\r\n……那么，我要去赢下它。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1cfa8bc79703968c5867894695c7cb7cf5f532ab6bee2b6d93427a633ec2e8ac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "110002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8870f5ba5000d07c7020618",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘 Pretty Derby！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c68d1ccbe412517d037eba3349a53caf52ee4216f3314987c5d59645520f8f8a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ebcfd730add038665b4a94f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有什么，正流淌进来……",
      "source_fingerprint": "71b43545108dcc1926d7960a21e8cf146ce43cd44bb5cb891df8ea0d87ef02c4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "120000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:508e69d70ca0487eca21406b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唯有获胜……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e574d585ceed3e9996529a5acb583fdcc8d14d32f785fd756acdb191cdcc68e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "1264"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d4572a5476fd6d1f0ac6c7c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我上了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "980a7ec4edfa6d1adf15641f4347f9c2840126ff143da4b3a0db3ad63034d737",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "1265"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5d91598e10a3e8cfceaa989",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是今天的登录奖励。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7cc7b99b32d8f34da6bd620973df2ae9a0a57751a69db6f6dffcae6088fc7c17",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:23e6ea3b96a2fe9ae5916fae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开始吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5340d32cafefeb07fb71f273be0d9e41c17a0c3f97ce3ec0784aa70ad39fd299",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "140000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56592ecf27115bbe3f71eac6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e34abed1ddb126fde54bfedaf035b92aac16d1e143243cc656102c6ded090c6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "140001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5cb4a952367abebc76373818",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼……",
      "source_fingerprint": "859051e831aa125febaf30affc00b2a41c40ac4b8d2ac6c3e681bad9b0d37a18",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "140002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48b2a1271cfb63068ea958c1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你很擅长呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5bd57330a7679c8974a0a663013f897f35d253463f1246037d16f672cebafabe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "140003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff2bf4e3ae63f82d090a3714",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……居然能抓到呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "61567a6596a0326a704b31559a83bd674230b0f8a3f5c2a3362a60f2d5601531",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "140004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63326b92d3c48100d3b3d498",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不过如此吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c372cea42868441d7f0a066e37ed1b58ae0399e7b07b3c718c16a6dc7f60017c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "140005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef806fa8250640ae7f884cbc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你很擅长呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5bd57330a7679c8974a0a663013f897f35d253463f1246037d16f672cebafabe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "140006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71ba826679b87f9be870b088",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……居然能抓到呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "61567a6596a0326a704b31559a83bd674230b0f8a3f5c2a3362a60f2d5601531",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "140007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2267bd2ec5ec471071921326",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有什么事？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8eb060fbec30bddbb8e692398fbc4efee7bca1c5a853f94a1f484aae372a54df",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "140008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7465bf7327692abc1c4faff0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……哈啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4dfe5c185621fdbbcf6b51ebcea7015f1a31d65529a7fe1e85f73af04d0085c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "140009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d789163b4cacb3ffe3399be5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不需要动一动吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "aacf3b7ae0821aa4fb07dcf3f966c9c2f66fe06742f0b0150570a8b119a4351d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "140010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88639a83187aebfd73535f43",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "连在一起了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "40bb7538178bdc24abb626778ad77b9d903bfaf752c8aa0cf022e2deafe89255",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "140011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bef00bb5b56da5daaeb5b61b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "靠得太近了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f58e5570a90bdf7ed6a10de63b37a4579c6f5e3719611d7a93a96b9bda11a644",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "140012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1943f7eecdecef3114d7d681",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "居然这么……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba7523ff4954f2c428b6bd2af77990981893fb9025aed1c246a3ef90eafd4255",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "140013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d77e15cd5f4322e571b5d043",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呃……",
      "source_fingerprint": "82fec3801d176574a5c73b753c0428097ba4efacd01f74d8bbeb0f256d85692f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "140014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9ea172388b275cf5f1d2a09",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "65376b8a86e35a0752a2faa889379d09ec563657e83fcdf098797820fd01d8ec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "140015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d23549bd04e3bb9582a8080",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是在浪费时间哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f75498803596c973f4e0fc758f8277ad98ca9ebecaa197b897c899dc305f97c4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "140016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:46e315ab394ed77b9aab2e4d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是的……",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e024616ec7a2bf1c748a0e016d56f11053ca841cb2a9d941ddb2fa396dd0aba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "140017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91a420ee14118ff28d656961",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊，分开了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "6271bd2355eee651f0ebd6e2adc7edfe9b81c5ccbd86d6d4f500645c7d1bb372",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "140018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52ea8ef733afecec51a3badf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明天的是这个。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b6911b60c85f9b0fde1828d6077e7fd57595f123fb7ffd3267bcfcec39fbae9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ff736c9d73c7666f75cc327",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……唔，怎么了……\r\n请开始吧……不把自己逼到绝境的话……\r\n是无法变强的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "60a9b92b00fd13d0b960fe3f3e2267fe6143e8b6543427cba47a389f3a8513e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "20000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ee90a8e80a86c7104087d74",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……已经习惯了。\r\n这点程度……我能承受。\r\n……没问题。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6d1a11069ef0637331630fbafea9c7b5993218631dd399759334d84e6e56d98",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "20001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40f7f16edfd1372b785492ea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "比任何人都要强，向着更高处——\n如果是我的话，\n正因为是我才能到达。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dadd9696f44f312507025938bf7ff12d7cd38485a6be4c040aee40710bbbe548",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fce02e05f94797f6db9a7730",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……我很集中。\r\n集中到一切都能清晰地感觉到。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d58bff96587eb37bce86eb18e3d67f3ad0239130e3de6315f7cf48dba1ab1645",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34addcf13c6246cfd2c19ebf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……鞋带，松了哦。\r\n……看你好像没注意到的样子。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a478de9ec30f42414783d7f28e9088d57a51f70ee082bbb149a88d725f550b7f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9b5ade5b4e0d4d27471ccaf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "桌上的训练用品\r\n目录里，我已经贴好标签了。\r\n请您过目考虑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "620ae6a486f66449d1d125bc3817a0f395a5e087c9118fc2592833f74592c488",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8732c2f13d4fa955bf60dd4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……在开始之前，我可以听会儿音乐\r\n吗？我想集中精神。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c360cdf7df535cc5c25deff6a92d949db2c0a313a46a4902e7d2c880b0eec8a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d3afe2759b534f9b3f99aff8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……爱如往昔同学。\r\n……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9e12a0e30417b6413685ac6da0bfd9c563b9f643d4bdc6cc8760183eb3b996d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca97229b85bd7996ff8ab1b5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不需要，您的关心……\r\n现在，请别跟我说话……\r\n我想，集中精神。",
      "source_fingerprint": "65557b3d65b9e16acad9911eb239f981cc70ce2bd1ad7924ae1826004f9a2443",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f37a3e4e649f1d4141924f19",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请离我远点。\r\n……为了彼此好，请离开……",
      "source_fingerprint": "12b0d73104e50fe9d67e0f6fe6786e42f79ab6bb8978929bd7e139c6904e8172",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f70ef7076e6500d6975f31cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……什么事？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0e901474453dfd48fb2ad3d9c6e688e8c12049783bde275d447a3d2a92cea41",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b8d1402310b045aa8deb0e4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……要开始的话，就快点。\r\n会混入杂念的……\r\n……那是无聊的，软弱的心……",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a83d7499d973b6cea732a243a195faf71419419ad7471566f72c8e14a6d02b5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b7b552049fd4f16599a338b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……是吗，这就是你的想法吗。\r\n合不来呢。和我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "824e8924e9600cf9beb86ab6c0709c6e445740d8c3244331938201de68dad4cb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e03ad14b5ffcc2957d401f01",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……请不要和我说话。\r\n……因为我会忍不住轻蔑你的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "26906e3423a2afa124e19a7491936da2af62471093bf8bd723746a784b7554e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6504469b1e08914fafb3e677",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "宛如冻结视线所及的一切\r\n——我将在此，展现出\r\n那压倒性的强大。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aae4c17d971132dc96803cf9e8ab93fad198c4291beb6d5d4a7c04646bcc9628",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff104682359538997791bdeb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "您只要考虑好赛后的\r\n流程就行了。剩下的……\r\n我会带着结果回来的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f190ce634549fa3d535763483be47d2de3affde03085766fb6de26fd5972fce4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c324187339ec2041b3cce79",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我不会让任何人追上。我所积累的东西\r\n比任何人都要多……\r\n不容许有任何松懈……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9fefb1354b08e66974e9a972ab461c8ec3e130fa32043db7782353b3e8678f8a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1118",
        "20025"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
